<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>06 / 学校端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>教师绩效：五类证据与七项比较背景</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={340} viewBox='0 0 700 340'><circle cx='350' cy='170' r='62' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='350' y='164' font-size='18' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>五类证据</text><text x='350' y='190' font-size='13' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>不是单一评分</text><rect x='%d' y='%d' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='%d' y='%d' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='%d' y='%d' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='%d' y='%d' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='135' y='100' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>学生进步、知识保持与独立迁移</text><text x='135' y='122' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>课堂观察与专业判断</text><text x='565' y='100' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>作业与考试设计与复核</text><text x='565' y='122' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>共性困难识别与后续支持</text><text x='135' y='348' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>教研贡献与经核实纠错</text><text x='565' y='348' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>七项背景：起点/班额/课时/资源/难度/完整度/样本量</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>评价口径</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>重点关注：教师面对学生起点和教学条件时取得的进步、作出的教学调整、提供支持的质量。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>不把一个模型评分或平均分作为全部绩效。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>即使使用统计调整，也不能把观察到的进步全部归因为某名教师。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>流程保障：展示分项依据、比较范围和不确定性；允许教师补充背景、核对数据并申请复核。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>权责边界：正式绩效决定由学校按明确规则和多来源证据作出；AI 提供分析依据，不自动作出奖惩或单一排名。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：学校端设计思路.md §3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 61 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>